OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry morning with sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Becoming cloudier in the
OL,7,Fafternoon with a few light showers,
OL,8,Fthese mainly in the west and north.
OL,9,FDrier and brighter again in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny showers will clear to
OL,13,Fleave a dry evening for most. Then the
OL,14,Frest of the night will be dry across
OL,15,Fall parts with clear periods. Becoming
OL,16,Frather chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
