OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FThe risk of a few light
OL,6,Fshowers across northern Aberdeenshire
OL,7,Fat first. Otherwise a dry day with
OL,8,Fsunny intervals turning hazier later
OL,9,Fin the day. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FBecoming widely unsettled from Monday,
OL,13,Fwith rain spreading northwards, at
OL,14,Ftimes heavy and persistent. Further
OL,15,Fspells of rain or showers are likely
OL,16,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
